{"id":"01a0657e-1365-7493-92e7-57aa97f1a484","chapterSlug":"rw8-13 F","paragraph":334,"wording":"[Fist Fighter]","event":"named","holderSlug":"alber","holderQuote":"But Alber took him apart in the little ring. He ducked, weaving, blocking some punches, letting the other fighter tire himself out. What was it called?"}
